      "content": "OpenAPI definition for the Hazelcast REST API exposed by cluster members. The REST service is disabled by default and must be enabled in member configuration. Endpoint groups (CLUSTER_READ, CLUSTER_WRITE, DATA, HEALTH_CHECK, PERSISTENCE, WAN, CP) gate access to specific operations.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Hazelcast",
